T_{\\rm{d,phot}}(v,t)\\approx\\left[\\frac{L_{\\rm{d}}(t)}{2\\sigma_{\\rm{SB}}\\varphi _{\\rm{d}}v(v_{\\rm{d,max}}-v_{\\rm{d,min}})t^{2}}\\right]^{1/4}. 

The total flux density from the dynamical ejecta can be expressed as

F_{\\rm{\\nu,d}}\\approx\\int_{v_{\\rm{d,min}}}^{v_{\\rm{d,max}}}\\frac{4\\pi\\varphi_ {\\rm{d}}vt^{2}}{h^{2}c^{2}}\\frac{h^{3}\\nu^{3}}{\\exp(h\\nu/k_{\\rm{B}}T_{\\rm{d,phot }}-1)}\\frac{1}{4\\pi D_{\\rm{L}}^{2}}dv. 

